title: Heinrich Brandler
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor
view-if: party_line = "right"
new-page: true

= The Chairman

The chairman of the party is not an adviser like the others. Heinrich Brandler leads the Zentrale because the Right holds the line, and while he leads, the party campaigns about one tenth harder, because the districts follow a chairman they know. If the line ever passes to another faction, so will the chairmanship, and so will the buff. Brandler can act once every three months.

